Article 21 (Support for Policies on Electronic Signature Certification)
The Korea Internet and Security Agency shall conduct the following business in order to create an environment in which electronic signatures can be safely and reliably used and to support policies on electronic signature certification:
Developing, distributing, and conducting research to standardize, technologies related to electronic signature certification;
Researching schemes related to electronic signature certification, mutual recognition, and other support for international cooperation;
Supporting public officials in inspecting certification-service providers under Article 16 (1);
Other matters necessary to support policies on electronic signature certification.

