A person who fails to comply with a corrective order issued under Article 17 without good cause shall be subject to an administrative fine not exceeding 20 million won.
Any of the following persons shall be subject to an administrative fine not exceeding five million won:
A person who uses an indication of compliance with the operating standards not as prescribed by Ministerial Decree of Science and ICT in violation of Article 13 (1);
A person who uses an indication of compliance with the operating standards or any other similar indication in violation of Article 13 (2);
A person who fails to prepare or publish the Certification Practice Statement in violation of Article 15 (1);
A person who fails to notify his or her subscribers of or to publish, the intention to cease or discontinue signature-certification services or measures to protect subscribers in violation of Article 15 (2), (3) or (4);
A person who fails to submit materials, submit any false materials, or refuses, obstructs or evades any public official who is entering any premises or is conducting an inspection in violation of Article 16 (1);
A person who fails to obtain insurance in violation of Article 20 (2).
Administrative fines under paragraphs (1) and (2) shall be imposed and collected by the Minister of Science and ICT, as prescribed by Presidential Decree.
